    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda yaalagira Musa ni Aaroni ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kobera Abaisiraeli oti buli musaadha anaatoonhanga okuva mu bitundu bye eby'ekyama olw'obulwaire, taabenga mulongoofu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "k'abe ng'akaatoonha oba ng'azibikiire olw'obulwaire obwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli buliri bw'anaalambaalangaku, na buli kintu ky'anaatyamangaku, tibiibenga birongoofu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era kiisi anaagemanga ku buliri obw'ow'obulwaire obwo, anaabanga n'okwoza ebivaalo bye era yaanaaba omubiri mu maadhi, era yaasigala nga tiimulongoofu okutuusa eigulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'oyo anaatyamanga ku kintu ow'obulwaire obwo ky'abaire atyaimeku, anaabanga n'okwoza ebivaalo bye era yaanaaba omubiri mu maadhi, aye era yaasigala nga tiimulongoofu okutuusa eigulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era n'oyo anaagemanga ku w'obulwaire obwo anaabanga n'okwoza ebivaalo bye era yaanaaba omubiri mu maadhi, aye era yaasigala nga tiimulongoofu okutuusa eigulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ow'obulwaire obwo bw'anaafuudhanga amatanta ku muntu omulongoofu, omuntu oyo anaabanga n'okwoza ebivaalo bye era yaanaaba omubiri mu maadhi, aye era yaasigala nga tiimulongoofu okutuusa eigulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekintu ekityamibwaku ku nsolo ali n'obulwaire obwo ky'anaatyamangaku tikiibenga kirongoofu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiisi anaagemanga ku kintu ow'obulwaire obwo ky'abaire atyaimeku, taabenga mulongoofu okutuusa eigulo. Era n'oyo anaakibbeedanga anaabanga n'okwoza ebivaalo bye era yaanaaba omubiri mu maadhi, aye era yaasigala nga tiimulongoofu okutuusa eigulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ow'obulwaire obwo bw'anaagemanga ku muntu nga tamaze kunaaba mu ngalo, ole ye bagemyeku anaabanga n'okwoza ebivaalo bye era yaanaaba omubiri mu maadhi, aye era yaasigala nga tiimulongoofu okutuusa eigulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekintu eky'eitosi ow'obulwaire obwo ky'anaagemangaku, kinaamenhebwanga. Na buli kintu kya muti ky'anaagemangaku, kinaanaazibwanga mu maadhi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ow'obulwaire obwo bw'anaawonanga obulwaire obwo, anaateegangaku enaku musanvu okwetukuza, memale yaayoza ebivaalo bye era yaanaaba omubiri mu maadhi agaviire mu nsulo edhikuuluula, olwo yaaba mulongoofu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olwomunaana aidha kutwalanga enjiibwa ibiri oba amaghemba amato abiri, ku mulyango gw'Eweema ey'Okwagaananirangamu ni Musengwa Katonda, yaabigha kabona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabona anaabighangayo olw'ekigheebwayo olw'ebibi, n'olw'ekigheebwayo ekyokebwa. Mu nsambo eyo kabona anaabighangayo ng'omusengo mu maiso ga Musengwa Katonda, olw'okutukuzibwa okw'omuntu oyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omusaadha bw'anaavangamu amaadhi ag'obusaadha, anaabanga n'okunaaba omubiri gwonagwona mu maadhi, aye era yaasigala nga tiimulongoofu okutuusa eigulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli kintu kya lugoye oba kya luwu, amaadhi ag'obusaadha ago kwe ganaatoonhanga kinaabanga n'okwozebwa, aye era kyasigala nga tiikirongoofu okutuusa eigulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era omusaadha bw'anaabanga ng'abaire n'omukazi bombi banaabanga n'okunaaba omubiri mu maadhi, aye era baasigala nga tiibalongoofu okutuusa eigulo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omukazi bw'anaabanga ng'ali mu biseera bye eby'okulwala, anaamalanga enaku musanvu nga tiimulongoofu. Era kiisi anaamugemangaku, taabenga mulongoofu okutuusa eigulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na buli kintu ky'anaalambalangaku, oba ky'anaatyamangaku ng'ali mu biseera bye eby'okulwala, tikiibenga kirongoofu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiisi anaagemanga ku buliri obw'omukazi oyo oba ku kintu kyonakyona ky'abaire atyaimeku, anaabanga n'okwoza ebivaalo bye era yaanaaba omubiri mu maadhi, aye era yaasigala nga tiimulongoofu okutuusa eigulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.21+LEV.15.22+LEV.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.21",
              "LEV.15.22",
              "LEV.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusaadha anaabanga naye ng'ali mu biseera bye eby'okulwala, yeena taabenga mulongoofu okumala enaku musanvu, era buli buliri omusaadha oyo bw'anaalambaalangaku tibuubenga bulongoofu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omukazi bw'anaavanga omusaayi okumala enaku kamaala nga ti n'ebiseera bye eby'okulwala, anaasigalanga nga tiimulongoofu. Era bw'anaabisangamu mu biseera by'amala buliidho ng'alwaire, anaasigalanga nga tiimulongoofu enaku dhoonadhoona dh'anaamalanga ng'ali kuva omusaayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli buliri bw'anaalambaalangaku, na buli kintu ky'anaatyamangaku mu kiseera ekyo, tibiibenga birongoofu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kiisi muntu anaagemanga ku bintu ebyo taabenga mulongoofu, anaabanga n'okwoza ebivaalo bye era yaanaaba omubiri mu maadhi, aye era yaasigala nga tiimulongoofu okutuusa eigulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukazi oyo bw'anaalekeranga okuva omusaayi, anaateeganga ghaabitagho enaku musanvu, memale yaaba omulongoofu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olwomunaana, aidha kutwalanga enjiibwa ibiri oba amaghemba amato abiri, eri kabona ku mulyango ogw'Eweema ey'Okwagaananirangamu ni Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabona anaabighangayo olw'ekigheebwayo olw'ebibi, n'olw'ekigheebwayo ekyokebwa. Mu nsambo eyo kabona anaabighangayo ng'omusengo mu maiso ga Musengwa Katonda, olw'okutukuzibwa okw'omukazi oyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
